## 1. Project Purpose

This is the **second practical email in the Nexus Tech portfolio**.

The first Nexus Tech email focused on promotional content, columns, and
Outlook ghost-table structure.

This project is intentionally simpler.

The main lesson is:

> **Build a clean email from a clear structure, control spacing, create
> a proper CTA, and make the HTML easier to maintain.**

We are not trying to make this email unnecessarily complicated.

Each project should teach a small number of useful skills that we carry
into the next project.

