# 10. Lesson 5 --- Three-Service Section

The "Why Nexus Tech?" section is our main layout practice.

We want:

``` text
Repairs | Refurbished Laptops | Upgrades
```

Each column can contain:

-   icon/image
-   heading
-   short description

Example:

``` text
[icon]

Repairs

Fast, reliable and
professional service.
```

The learning is:

-   three-column structure
-   equal-width thinking
-   vertical alignment
-   spacing
-   Outlook fallback
-   inline-block/table-cell concepts
-   consistent typography

