# 11. Lesson 6 --- Spacing and Paragraphs

Stop relying on browser defaults.

For example:

``` html
<p style="margin:0;">
```

or:

``` html
<p style="margin:0; padding:10px;">
```

### Why?

Email clients can treat default margins differently.

Think:

``` text
margin = outside spacing
padding = inside spacing
```

If precise spacing matters, control it yourself.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 12. Lesson 7 --- Build a Real CTA

In Project 1, the "Buy Now!" element was visually styled as a paragraph.

For this project, improve that.

A CTA should normally be a real link:

``` html
<a href="https://example.com"
   style="...">
    GET MY 10% OFF
</a>
```

The user needs to be able to click it, activate it with keyboard
navigation, and use it in a real email campaign.

The visual styling comes second.

