# 14. Lesson 8 --- Images

The mockup uses icons/graphics.

For the actual project, images are useful because email development
requires us to understand image behaviour.

Practice:

``` html
<img
    src="..."
    alt="..."
    width="..."
    style="display:block; width:100%; max-width:...; height:auto;"
>
```

Learn what each part does.

### Important

`alt` text provides information when:

-   images are blocked
-   a screen reader is being used
-   an image fails to load

