**Yes, this project can use images.**

The mockup is **not a text-only email**.

Keep image usage controlled.

Suggested image roles:

### Header

Logo image or text-based logo.

### Service section

Three small icons:

-   repair
-   laptop/refurbished
-   upgrade

### Repair CTA

One supporting laptop/repair illustration or icon.

The goal is not to fill the email with images.

