# 16. Lesson 10 --- Image Widths

Do not repeat the previous project's problem where a product image had a
very large HTML width while sitting inside a much smaller card.

### Rule

> **The image's declared dimensions should make sense for the space
> where the image lives.**

Make the HTML width and CSS width sensible for the actual component.

