# 27. Development Rule

### Build first. Polish second.

Do not spend an hour choosing a perfect icon or shadow while the HTML
structure is still broken.

Our order is:

``` text
STRUCTURE
↓
LAYOUT
↓
COMPATIBILITY
↓
SPACING
↓
TYPOGRAPHY
↓
IMAGES
↓
POLISH
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 28. Testing Checklist

### HTML

-   [ ] DOCTYPE present
-   [ ] `<html>` correct
-   [ ] `<head>` present
-   [ ] viewport meta present
-   [ ] body margins reset
-   [ ] tags balanced
-   [ ] tables balanced
-   [ ] links have `href`
