### Outlook

-   [ ] MSO conditional comments are correctly opened
-   [ ] `<td>` elements are balanced
-   [ ] `<tr>` is balanced
-   [ ] `<table>` is balanced
-   [ ] Widths make sense

### Visual

-   [ ] No debug background colours
-   [ ] No placeholder text
-   [ ] No accidental borders
-   [ ] No broken images
-   [ ] Spacing looks intentional

